# Tinybones, Bauble Burglar: "During your turn, you may play cards you don't own with stash counters on them from exile" (CR 601.3,
# 604.1). Both players have a Tinybones. On turn 4 Bot2 activates its own, Bot1 chooses to discard its Lightning Bolt and
# Bot2's Tinybones exiles it with a stash counter. On Bot1's turn 5 neither can cast it: Bot1's own Tinybones doesn't let it
# cast a card it owns, and it isn't Bot2's turn for Bot2's, though Bot2 has Mox Sapphire open. On turn 6, Bot2's own turn, Bot2
# casts it at Bot1 (the "may": it waited a turn in exile), and the Bolt, leaving exile, goes to its owner's graveyard.

